<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK SEPT JOBLESS DIPS TO 12.23 PCT (12.31 PCT).</title>
<headline>SLOVAK SEPT JOBLESS DIPS TO 12.23 PCT (12.31 PCT).</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in Slovakia in September totalled 313,930, or 12.23 percent of the workforce, down from 12.31 percent in August, the Slovak Ministry of Social Affairs and Labour said on Thursday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK UNEMPLOYMENT RATE   Sept '96    Aug '96     Sept '95</p>
<p>  total jobless		  313,930    316,093     336,023</p>
<p>  percentage of workforce     12.23	12.31	 13.20</p>
<p>-- Peter Laca, Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-536-3687</p>
